      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE COMES RHEA (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from five tries. Hit the frame latest (25.77) when third at Murray Bridge in a Grade 6. Makes strong appeal on best. LAVENDER LANE (4) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 530m at this track two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing second at this track last start. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in this for a long way. SCOTT SCOTCH (8) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (31.14) at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading chance. BUFFY'S NO ANGEL (5) was in the money again last start when second at this track (31.11). Solid beginner and with a good start can find clear running from trap one.",
